{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 31","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of real values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> satisfying the equality <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/e/71e46e7fbb79ddd224a3faf87de43a6625a60d0f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_ax)(\\log_bx) = \\log_ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"185\" height=\"20\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/5/8c5b034b1de7e6779534e35369dab48f640a5fb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a &gt; 0, b &gt; 0, a \\neq 1, b \\neq 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"191\" height=\"17\" />, is: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/d/91dd21e78eaf90c4ea062ef7a44e18750491cedc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ 1 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ 2 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) }\\ \\text{a finite integer greater than 2}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\ \\text{not finite}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"636\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>From the properties of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithms\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Logarithms\">logarithms</a>, we know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/7/ac7c471db58ca8c2a3c3ab01cdb4f87352909536.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_ax)(\\log_xb)=\\log_ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"184\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/a/a2a12325b2839d75db6daffbf59078635d0bb445.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_xb=\\frac{1}{\\log_bx}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"116\" height=\"43\" />. Thus, to satisfy the given equation, we are looking for values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/2/2523f607b77faed0e1b57f7ebd0c36a08e01e241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_bx=\\frac{1}{\\log_bx}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"117\" height=\"43\" />, or when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/8/a286bcbcfe74b2c387266985c652eb5425f8509d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_bx=\\pm 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"19\" />. This happens either when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/1/741720281e465fc7461c32d504f6d54c5bcaff7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=b$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/e/25e9baf7b68a7733d46bb79b3f575fbfca51c73a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\frac{1}{b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"50\" height=\"38\" />. Thus we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> solutions, consistent with answer choice <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/7/5f7bfdbb5e480fd502f53b019a98dbc31f2069ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"40\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">Problem 30</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">Problem 32</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1965 AHSME Prob